# The subject model pin (subject detection, 2026-10-26; media/subject_map.py): U-2-Netp, the
# small U^2-Net salient-object model (Qin et al., 2020; Apache-2.0, media/subject_model.LICENSE),
# as rembg's ONNX export. Its one home, read by scripts/subject_model.py, which the worker image's
# `subject-model` stage (Dockerfile) and every CI leg that runs the measurement call; the fetch
# refuses any file whose size or SHA-256 is not the one below. The only source is that third-party
# release, so a bump edits all three lines from a file checked by hand.
SUBJECT_MODEL_URL=https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg/releases/download/v0.0.0/u2netp.onnx
SUBJECT_MODEL_SHA256=309c8469258dda742793dce0ebea8e6dd393174f89934733ecc8b14c76f4ddd8
SUBJECT_MODEL_BYTES=4574861
